mine task
  mine term, term task
    mine term
      site name
    mine list
      mine form, like head
        site head
    mine list
      mine form, like take
        site take
    mine list
      mine form, like flow
        site flow
    mine list
      mine form, like task
        site task
    mine maybe
      mine form, like like
        site like
    mine maybe
      mine form, like wait
        site wait
    mine maybe
      mine form, like risk
        site risk
    mine maybe
      mine form, like hide
        site hide
    mine maybe
      mine form, like fold
        site fold
    mine maybe
      mine form, like note
        site note
    mine list
      mine form, like tag
        site tag
